# Rescuing Vael from the Cathedral (Milestone 20a, any other start). Plays on
# reaching Vael's rune after the Fallen Guardian is beaten.

face player up
emote vael !
say Vael: You... you came. The Guardian wore the Cathedral's own crest. I watched its light go out.
say Vael: If you've come this far, there are others still locked away. Frank told you?
emote vael note
say Vael: Then my shield is yours. Let's bring the light back to this place.
join vael
despawn vael
sound level_up
narrate Vael joins the party!
set cleared_cathedral
